  (text "ESSENTIAL 3V3 — LMR51635XDDCR INTEGRATED DEVELOPMENT"
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8511a84a-7fac-43c2-bf59-93571b00e104")
  )
  (text "EXTERNAL FIXTURE: SYS_PWR_PERMITTED and GND represent a bounded permitted source.\nInput/return PWR_FLAGs do not implement source isolation, RBF, charger or battery protection."
    (at 25.4 35.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0792ea97-3957-44ac-bd80-e3345f387cbc")
  )
  (text "5..35 V development envelope; 4.5 V sensitivity. EN = VIN; starts without MCU.\n2 A is steady sizing only. Actual MCU/IHU/CAN ramp/load-step budget and transient acceptance remain open."
    (at 25.4 46.99 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6ec3c0da-e455-40e1-b681-8a35bea71dc4")
  )
  (text "OUTPUT: 8 x 22uF / 25V X7R, 176uF nominal.\nRequire >=12uF effective each through bias/temp/aging; >=96uF total conditional.\nThis floor is NOT proof of CAN 3.0V minimum during heavy load steps."
    (at 223.52 66.04 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6a46b973-2364-4d50-a81f-1ed039c66c8e")
  )
  (text "No input bulk added; upstream capacitance/source-impedance budget remains open.\nInput ceramics require >=2.2uF aggregate effective through35V.\nOutput PWR_FLAG marks actual buck output after L400; no additional rail source."
    (at 25.4 140.97 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "75e5e298-0708-41c5-a386-e202e79a7afc")
  )
  (text "STATIC SETPOINT:31.6k/10.2k,0.1%,25ppm/K. Nominal3.278V.\nScreened static range3.2328..3.3244V. CFF omitted per TI Table8-2.\nSelected LC, hot inductance, thermal path and actual loop/load still require qualification."
    (at 241.3 157.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a2eb4f1a-854e-48c9-86d0-56d821411ea3")
  )
  (text "UVLO / WEAK SOURCE OPEN: operating VINmin4.3V; UVLO rise max4.25V, fall3.8Vtyp.\nNo external UV supervisor or anti-chatter design; weak solar can collapse/restart.\nNo MCU action is required to start essential power."
    (at 25.4 180.34 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fb40a7f0-e36f-454b-864d-793f1dbcf8e6")
  )
  (text "OPEN AUTONOMOUS 3V3 OV CONTAINMENT: failed-short high-side can expose MCU/CAN\nand25V output bank to~35V. Upstream solar OV protection does not contain this fault.\nThis stage does not establish complete EPS essential-power acceptance."
    (at 25.4 213.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3bf8fb0f-78b7-435e-8a88-19415fd84330")
  )
  (text "POLICY OPEN: S03 native severity and S11 field-display APIs unavailable.\nExisting custom U400 reused; S08 original review-marker coverage unresolved. No PCB synchronization."
    (at 25.4 238.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c10a09e6-2880-4397-b63c-8b7fc833248f")
  )
